#
# NexoraOS — package list for the live ISO (x86_64)
# -----------------------------------------------
# ONLY official repo packages (core/extra/multilib) belong here.
# AUR-only packages are installable post-boot via Nexora Store.
#
# The list is intentionally MINIMAL to keep the ISO under 2 GB (GitHub
# release asset limit). Heavy apps (libreoffice, obs-studio, gcc, rust,
# jdk, nvidia drivers, virtualbox, etc.) are installable from Nexora Store
# after boot.
#

## ---- base system ----
base
base-devel
linux
linux-headers
linux-firmware
systemd
systemd-sysvcompat
filesystem
pacman
pacman-contrib
archlinux-keyring
